	| sketch |
	[ -1 1 ] ( side |
		sketch [ [ side 0.30 * 0.55 0.38 ] [ side 0.17 * 0.83 0.06 ] [ side 0.33 * 0.46 0.12 ] ] [ 0 0.6 0.2 ] glass-colour sketch-painted-plate
	) each
	sketch [ [ -0.30 0.55 0.38 ] [ 0.30 0.55 0.38 ] ] sketch-path
	sketch [ [ -0.30 0.55 0.38 ] [ 0.30 0.55 0.38 ] [ 0.17 0.83 0.06 ] [ -0.17 0.83 0.06 ] ] [ 0 0.6 0.1 ] glass-colour sketch-painted-plate
	hurricane-hood-frames to frames
	frames first to hoop
	[ [ -1 0 1 2 ] [ 1 5 4 3 ] ] ( pair |
		pair spread to top-corner to middle-corner to sill-corner to side
		sketch [ [ side 0.33 * 0.46 0.12 ] [ side 0.17 * 0.83 0.06 ] hoop top-corner @i hoop middle-corner @i hoop sill-corner @i ] [ 0 0.6 0.0 ] glass-colour sketch-painted-plate
	) each
	sketch [ [ -0.17 0.83 0.06 ] [ 0.17 0.83 0.06 ] hoop 3 @i hoop 2 @i ] [ 0 0.6 0.04 ] glass-colour sketch-painted-plate
	( point | [ point first 1.03 * point second 0.01 + point 2 @i ] ) to outside
	frames ( frame | sketch frame outside map sketch-path ) each
	0 frames size 1- 1 do k
		frames k @i to front
		frames k 1+ @i to back
		0 front size 1- 1 do corner
			sketch [ front corner @i front corner 1+ @i back corner 1+ @i back corner @i ] sketch-points to corners
			sketch@faces [ corners [ 0 0.5 front corner @i 2 @i ] glass-colour unoutlined + ] add-last! drop
		loop
	loop
	0 6 1 do corner
		sketch [ frames first corner @i frames last corner @i ] outside map sketch-path
	loop ;

\ a bar from one point to another, a rectangular tube, a half-width across and a half-width along the line of flight, its faces square to that line and to the plane through the bar and it, filled in a colour, or the object's where null; its ends' outlines and its four long edges as lines
