	| sketch start end half-across half-forward colour |
	end start v- v-unit [ 0 0 1 ] v-cross v-unit to across
	[ 0 0 1 ] to forward
	start end v+ 0.5 v* to middle
	[ [ -1 -1 ] [ 1 -1 ] [ 1 1 ] [ -1 1 ] ] ( signs | across signs first half-across * v* forward signs second half-forward * v* v+ ) map to offsets
	[ start end ] ( point | sketch offsets ( offset | point offset v+ ) map sketch-points ) map to ends
	sketch ends first join-loop
	sketch ends second join-loop
	0 4 1 do k
		k 1+ 4 mod to next
		sketch ends first k @i ends second k @i sketch-edge
		[ ends first k @i ends first next @i ends second next @i ends second k @i ] to corners
