			strut spread to head-along to foot-along to foot-up
			gladiator-upper-height 0.02 + to head-up
			sketch [ [ side 0.35 * foot-up foot-along 0.06 - ] [ side 0.35 * foot-up foot-along 0.06 + ] [ side 0.55 * head-up head-along 0.06 + ] [ side 0.55 * head-up head-along 0.06 - ] ] [ side 0.90 * -0.44 0 ] 0.025 dark-green-colour sketch-thick-outline
		) each
