	[ [ [ [ -3.80 -3.80 gladiator-fin-bottom ] [ -3.80 0.55 ] [ -3.92 0.84 ] [ -4.03 1.03 ] [ -4.03 -4.03 gladiator-fin-bottom ] ] roundel-red-colour ]
	  [ [ [ -4.03 -4.03 gladiator-fin-bottom ] [ -4.03 1.03 ] [ -4.09 1.09 ] [ -4.26 1.26 ] [ -4.26 -4.26 gladiator-fin-bottom ] ] roundel-white-colour ]
	  [ [ [ -4.26 -4.26 gladiator-fin-bottom ] [ -4.26 1.26 ] [ -4.44 1.38 ] [ -4.50 1.41 ] [ -4.50 -4.50 gladiator-fin-bottom ] ] roundel-blue-colour ] ] ;

\ the fuselage roundel, a Type A1 35 in across as the Hurricane's, behind the lower wing's trailing edge 2.4 m aft of the origin, its centre 5 cm above the thrust line (its place an estimate)
-2.4 constant gladiator-fuselage-roundel-along

\ the Gladiator Mk II: the fuselage, the Mercury's cowling with the engine's face dark inside its lip, the black spinner and the turning propeller's disc 3.20 m across, the windscreen and the hood, the two wings with their roundels, the struts and wires, the fixed undercarriage and the tail wheel, the tailplane with its elevators and struts, the fin and rudder with the fin flash, the aerial mast on the fairing 1.56 m aft, 0.29 m tall, its wire aft to a short pole on the fin's leading edge 4.28 m aft, both measured on the side view, and a wire forward to each upper wing 1.96 m out near its trailing edge, 0.16 m forward of the origin, where the plan view draws them ending, the two Brownings in their gondolas under the lower wings, the two Vickers guns' troughs along the fuselage's sides at the thrust line's height, dark slots 8 cm deep from just ahead of the windscreen to the cowling's rear with the barrels lying in them and standing out ahead, as the side view and photographs show them, and the fuselage roundel; in Dark Green above and Sky beneath, without the Dark Earth's pattern, which no drawing of the flight's aircraft was found for
: gladiator-sketch ( hooded -- sketch )
	| hooded |
	new-model-sketch sky-paint-colour :under-colour ! spitfire-under-turn :under-turn ! to model
	model gladiator-cowling-rings [ 0 0 0 ] 12 sketch-body
	model@faces last radiator-intake-colour add-last! drop
	model gladiator-fuselage-rings [ 0 0 0 ] 12 sketch-body
	model gladiator-fairing-rings [ 0 0 0 ] 8 sketch-body
	model@faces size to spinner-first-face
	model gladiator-spinner-rings [ 0 0 0 ] 12 sketch-body
	spinner-first-face model@faces size 1 do k model@faces k @i spinner-colour add-last! drop loop
	model [ 0 0.04 2.38 ] [ 1 0 0 ] [ 0 1 0 ] 0.5 24 ring-of [ 0 0 1.5 ] radiator-intake-colour sketch-painted-plate
	model gladiator-hub 1.60 sketch-propeller-disc
	model sketch-gladiator-blisters
	model sketch-gladiator-gondolas
	model sketch-gladiator-exhausts
	hooded if
		model sketch-gladiator-hood
	else
		gladiator-hood-frames to frames [ 2 6 ] ( k | model frames k @i sketch-path ) each
		[ -1 1 ] ( side | side gladiator-windscreen-panel to panel model panel 8 skip panel 7 take concat sketch-path model side gladiator-windscreen-brace sketch-path ) each
		model [ [ -0.08 0.72 0.16 ] [ -0.08 1.05 -0.28 ] [ 0.08 1.05 -0.28 ] [ 0.08 0.72 0.16 ] ] sketch-path
	then
	model sketch-gladiator-wings
	model sketch-gladiator-struts
	model sketch-gladiator-undercarriage
	model gladiator-tailplane [ gladiator-elevator ] 0 gladiator-tailplane-height gladiator-tailplane-half-thickness sketch-thick-surface
	[ -1 1 ] ( side | model [ side 1.0 * gladiator-tailplane-height 0.05 - -4.5 ] [ side 0.25 * -0.30 -4.0 ] 0.015 null sketch-strut ) each
	model 0 gladiator-fin gladiator-rudder gladiator-fin-half-thickness sketch-thick-fin
	model gladiator-fin-flash gladiator-fin-half-thickness sketch-fin-flash
	model [ 0 0.93 -1.56 ] [ 0 1.22 -1.56 ] 0.015 null sketch-strut
	model [ 0 1.26 -4.28 ] [ 0 1.44 -4.28 ] 0.01 null sketch-strut
	model [ [ 0 1.22 -1.56 ] [ 0 1.44 -4.28 ] ] sketch-path
	[ -1 1 ] ( side | model [ [ 0 1.22 -1.56 ] [ side 1.96 * 1.96 gladiator-upper-height gladiator-height-at gladiator-depth 0.6 * + 0.16 ] ] sketch-path ) each
	[ -1 1 ] ( side |
		model [ [ 0.575 0.01 0.12 ] [ 0.575 0.09 0.12 ] [ 0.56 0.09 1.55 ] [ 0.56 0.01 1.55 ] ] ( point | [ point first side * point second point 2 @i ] ) map [ 0 0.05 0.8 ] model-ink sketch-painted-plate
		model [ side 0.58 * 0.05 0.20 ] [ side 0.57 * 0.05 1.70 ] 0.018 exhaust-colour sketch-strut
	) each
	model gladiator-rings 12 gladiator-fuselage-roundel-along 0.05 hurricane-fuselage-roundel-radii [ roundel-yellow-colour roundel-blue-colour roundel-white-colour roundel-red-colour ] sketch-skin-roundel
	model ;

: gladiator-model ( -- model ) true gladiator-sketch dark-green-colour sketch>object ;

\ the Gladiator as its pilot sees it from inside the hood, the hood's frames alone so the view through it is clear
: gladiator-cockpit-model ( -- model ) false gladiator-sketch dark-green-colour sketch>object ;
